# Copy to redact.local.txt, fill in, chmod 600, and add to .gitignore:
#
#     .claude/hooks/redact.local.txt
#
# One literal secret per line. Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored.
# These are matched as literal strings (re.escape), so no escaping needed.
#
# Why this file exists: the renderer's built-in regexes only match well-known
# platform key shapes (sk-, ghp_, AKIA, 64-hex, Bearer). Self-hosted credentials
# have no such shape -- on one real project they scored 0 regex hits against 89
# actual occurrences. Nothing but a literal list catches those.
#
# Keep in sync with production systemd / .env. A credential added there but not
# here goes into the very next session archive in plain text.

# <admin password>
# <third-party app secret>
# <third-party sign key>
# <JWT signing secret>
# <webhook shared secret>
